## 🚀 What is FlowForge?

**FlowForge** is a Python based business automation platform designed to connect business communication, customer data, calendars, tasks, and AI into one intelligent workflow.

Instead of forcing businesses to manually process every email, update customer records, schedule meetings, create follow up tasks, and track productivity, FlowForge automates the repetitive work.

### The core idea

> **Communication → Intelligence → Data → Action → Follow Up → Insights**

FlowForge transforms incoming business communication into structured business activity.

---

## 🎯 The Problem

Businesses waste huge amounts of time manually handling repetitive administrative work.

Typical workflow:

```text
Email arrives
     ↓
Employee reads email
     ↓
Employee identifies customer
     ↓
Employee updates CRM
     ↓
Employee checks calendar
     ↓
Employee schedules meeting
     ↓
Employee creates task
     ↓
Employee remembers to follow up
     ↓
Employee updates reports